{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-7ade6206-fda1-41ee-b230-af1acda70efa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-854ec4d9f90eda78","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/h5/l8qslbp55w5621qf9ngsh5jc0000gn/T/epic-RHAISTRAT-8005-sjigf84f/artifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-8005-decomposition.md","content":"# Decomposition Summary: RHAISTRAT-8005\n\n**Strategy**: EvalHub UI: Real-Time Evaluation Job Progress and State Visibility\n\n## Triage Outcome\n\nStrategy is S-sized, single active component (eval-hub-ui plugin), single implementing team (ODH Dashboard) — but the **genuine-unknowns escape condition applies**: the strategy's Open Questions table contains two unknowns flagged \"needs validation\" whose answers change what downstream epics do (mid-run availability of `status.benchmarks[]` determines whether the detail-polling layer and benchmark-progress display exist as specified; `status.message.message_code` values determine whether the pre-start/runtime failure distinction is implementable). Per Step 0, below-threshold does not apply; full decomposition performed.\n\n## Staff Engineer Input Overrides\n\nStaff Engineer Input was parsed first and takes precedence. Logged overrides / resolutions:\n\n1. **Data availability constraint**: \"Assume we do not have any more data available to us other than what is already available from this API\" — no Server-side API extensions; all work builds on the two existing endpoints (`GET /evaluations/jobs`, `GET /evaluations/jobs/{id}`). The AI-generated Technical Approach already conforms; no divergence.\n2. **Latency window open question resolved**: 10 seconds is sufficient for state-transition visibility.\n3. **Page Visibility open question resolved**: yes, polling pauses when the tab is backgrounded.\n4. **Concurrency model directed**: poll only jobs on the currently displayed table page; max 5 parallel detail fetches in round-robin; next cycle timer starts